{"id":"662807","name":"沙茶白萝卜牛腩","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/662807/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛腩","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜片","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛腩改刀切块，冷水下锅焯烫出血水后洗净。","img":"images/662807/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"生姜洗净切片。","img":"images/662807/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅中热油放入姜片。","img":"images/662807/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入牛腩翻炒。","img":"images/662807/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入沙茶酱。","img":"images/662807/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"适量蚝油，老抽。","img":"images/662807/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"翻炒均匀上色入味。","img":"images/662807/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/662807/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将牛腩转入高压锅，大火煮开中小火压20分钟。","img":"images/662807/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"白萝卜去皮洗净切小块。","img":"images/662807/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"分钟后的牛腩开盖。","img":"images/662807/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入白萝卜，继续盖上盖子小火压5分钟左右。","img":"images/662807/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅前少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/662807/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662807/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/662807/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}